WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.151 line:91%
Chapter 19. Find any page fast, and start your class in two clicks.

00:00:06.562 --> 00:00:10.551 line:91%
Can't find a page? Open the menu, and tap "Find".

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:18.051 line:91%
Type a few letters. It finds pages, lessons, games, classes, students, and answers from the help.

00:00:18.514 --> 00:00:21.852 line:91%
Press Enter, or click a result, to open it.

00:00:22.303 --> 00:00:24.631 line:91%
A student's name works too.

00:00:28.348 --> 00:00:37.331 line:91%
Or tap the microphone, and say the name of a page, like "attendance". On a phone, it needs the internet, or Google's offline English.

00:00:37.791 --> 00:00:43.051 line:91%
At the top of each page, the path shows where you are. Press "Back" to go back.

00:00:43.512 --> 00:00:50.191 line:91%
Use a page often? Press the star. The page goes to "My pages", in the menu and on Home.

00:00:51.547 --> 00:00:57.252 line:91%
On Home, "My pages" and "Recent" open the pages you used, in one tap.

00:00:57.703 --> 00:01:04.413 line:91%
And the "Start class" box on Home: first take attendance, then start the next test. One click each.
